    "faq_U7EXL8": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_fzMaty": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What comes along with the cap?",
            "answer": "<p>Each LEGXI × Arshdeep Singh AS02 Edition Cap comes in premium LEGXI packaging, designed for a ceremonial unboxing experience. The box includes the exclusive AS02 Cap and features ‘For the Chosen’ elegantly embossed, symbolizing the spirit of legacy and belonging to the select few.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_zn6QHg": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long will it take to deliver my cap?",
            "answer": "<p>Your order will typically be <strong>delivered within 5-7 business days<\/strong> across India. Once shipped, you’ll receive tracking details via email or WhatsApp.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_GABWk9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the size of the cap?",
            "answer": "<p>The cap features a universal adjustable fit with a 6-panel design for maximum comfort and durability. It’s crafted to suit all head sizes while maintaining a structured premium look.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_Awn8mF": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the cap returnable?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. In case you receive a damaged or defective piece, your order is fully returnable or replaceable. We take great care to ensure every cap meets LEGXI’s quality and presentation standards.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_MHCCNJ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are the designs sticker patches or embroidery?",
            "answer": "<p>This premium cap features full embroidery detailing - no stickers or patches. Every element, from the LEGXI insignia to the AS02 mark and ‘For the Chosen’ emblem, is meticulously embroidered to ensure lasting quality, rich texture, and a truly premium finish.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        }
      },
